### Get all hotels
GET http://localhost:3000/hotels

### Create a new hotel
POST http://localhost:3000/hotels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sita": "CUCBA",
  "hotel_name": "Test Hotel",
  "opening_date": "2026-08-01"
}

### Preview GM reminder email
GET http://localhost:3000/hotels/1/email-preview/gm_reminder

### Monthly report — notes for the current month
GET http://localhost:3000/monthly-notes

### Monthly report — notes for a specific month
GET http://localhost:3000/monthly-notes?month=2026-08

### Monthly report — add a rebranding note
POST http://localhost:3000/monthly-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "month": "2026-08",
  "kind": "rebranding",
  "sita": "SAKHO1",
  "old_value": "Park Inn by Radisson Al Khobar",
  "new_value": "Radisson Hotel Al Khobar"
}

### Monthly report — add a free-text update
POST http://localhost:3000/monthly-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "month": "2026-08",
  "kind": "other",
  "note": "Alexanderplatz switched to managed"
}